| Type | Structure | Purpose |
|------|-----------|---------|
| `cmd_vel` | `{"type": "cmd_vel", "linear_mm_s": float, "angular_mdeg_s": float}` | Motor velocity command |
| `control` | `{"type": "control", "action": "start"\|"stop"\|"estop"}` | Run-state gate |
| `tuning_update` | `{"type": "tuning_update", "max_pwm_duty": int, "max_linear_speed": int, ...}` | Live tuning patch (firmware key names) |
