### **5. MESSAGE SCHEMA SUMMARY**

#### **Arduino (MCU) ← Backend (Downlink)**

| Type | Structure | Purpose |
|------|-----------|---------|
| `cmd_vel` | `{"type": "cmd_vel", "linear_mm_s": float, "angular_mdeg_s": float}` | Motor velocity command |
| `control` | `{"type": "control", "action": "start"\|"stop"\|"estop"}` | Run-state gate |
| `tuning_update` | `{"type": "tuning_update", "max_pwm_duty": int, "max_linear_speed": int, ...}` | Live tuning patch (firmware key names) |
| `tuning_save` | `{"type": "tuning_save"}` | Persist to EEPROM |
| `tuning_reset` | `{"type": "tuning_reset"}` | Reset to firmware defaults |
| `proximity` | `{"type": "proximity", "min_distance_mm": int}` | Collision guard data from LIDAR |
| `ping` | `{"type": "ping"}` | Watchdog heartbeat |

#### **Arduino (MCU) → Backend (Uplink)**

| Type | Structure | Purpose |
|------|-----------|---------|
| `hello` | `{"type": "hello", "device": "arduino_uno_r4", "fw": "1.0.0", "ip": "...", "config": {...}}` | Device announces itself + reports its current config |
| `odom` | `{"type": "odom", "t_ms": int, "x_mm": float, "y_mm": float, "theta_rad": float, "linear_mm_s": float, "angular_mdeg_s": float, "ticks_l": int, "ticks_r": int, "duty_l": int, "duty_r": int, "running": bool, "collision": bool, "rssi": int, ["battery_v": float]}` | Odometry + telemetry |
| `ack` | `{"type": "ack", "for": "tuning_update"\|"tuning_save"\|"ping", "ok": bool}` | Acknowledgement |
| `log` | `{"type": "log", "source": "motion", "level": "info"\|"warn"\|"error", "msg": "..."}` | Logging |

#### **Frontend ↔ Backend (WebSocket /ws/app)**

```javascript
// Frontend → Backend
{ "type": "control", "action": "start"|"stop"|"estop" }
{ "type": "drive", "linear_mm_s": float, "angular_mdeg_s": float }
{ "type": "tuning_update", "values": { "param_name": value, ... } }
{ "type": "tuning_save" }
{ "type": "tuning_reset" }
{ "type": "set_mode", "mode": "manual"|"nav2" }
{ "type": "ping" }

// Backend → Frontend (via HUB.send_to or HUB.broadcast)
{ "topic": "schema", "data": { "params": [...], "sections": [...] } }
{ "topic": "status", "data": { ... } }
{ "topic": "tuning", "data": { "values": {...}, "dirty": [...], "acked": {...}, "saved": {...} } }
{ "topic": "log", "data": { "source": "...", "level": "...", "msg": "..." } }
{ "topic": "drive_echo", "data": { "linear_mm_s": float, "angular_mdeg_s": float } }
{ "topic": "reply", "data": { "ok": bool, "msg": string } }
```

